  "reference_solution": "[정답] ⑤\n\n[해설]\n$\\sin^{4} \\theta + \\cos^{4} \\theta$$= \\left( \\sin^{2} \\theta + \\cos^{2} \\theta \\right)^{2} - 2 \\sin^{2} \\theta \\cos^{2} \\theta$\n$= 1 - 2 \\sin^{2} \\theta \\cos^{2} \\theta$$= \\frac{23}{32}$\n에서 $\\sin^{2} \\theta \\cos^{2} \\theta = \\frac{9}{64}$\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$에서 $\\sin \\theta > 0$, $\\cos \\theta < 0$이므로\n$\\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta = - \\frac{3}{8}$\n$\\left( \\sin \\theta - \\cos \\theta \\right)^{2} = 1 - 2 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta = \\frac{7}{4}$\n따라서 $\\sin \\theta - \\cos \\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{2}$\n",
